      "changelog_device": "System\n\u2022 Updated to the September 2026 security patch\n\u2022 Reworked the system update flow: resumable downloads, package verification and background checks\n\u2022 Reduced jank when returning to recents from a full-screen app\n\u2022 Faster cold app starts after a reboot\n\u2022 Lowered memory pressure on the system server under heavy multitasking\n\u2022 Fixed a rare watchdog reboot when unlocking with many notifications pending\n\nCamera\n\u2022 Updated camera HAL, fixing green tint on the ultrawide in low light\n\u2022 Faster shot-to-shot time in night mode\n\u2022 Improved autofocus tracking on moving subjects\n\u2022 Fixed exposure jumping when switching between lenses mid-recording\n\u2022 Video stabilisation no longer crops more than intended at 4K60\n\nDisplay\n\u2022 Smoother refresh-rate transitions between 60 and 120 Hz\n\u2022 Fixed flicker at the lowest brightness levels\n\u2022 Corrected colour shift in the always-on display at low brightness\n\nConnectivity\n\u2022 Improved Wi-Fi roaming between access points on the same network\n\u2022 Fixed Bluetooth codec switching between LDAC and AAC\n\u2022 More reliable 5G to LTE handover while moving\n\u2022 Fixed occasional crash when switching SIMs\n\nGlyph\n\u2022 Fixed the Glyph interface staying lit after a dismissed notification\n\u2022 Added a brightness ramp when the composition starts\n\nBattery\n\u2022 Reduced idle drain by around 8% in standby\n\u2022 Improved thermal behaviour during long camera sessions\n\u2022 Fixed charging animation not showing on the always-on display\n\nFixes\n\u2022 Fingerprint unlock no longer fails on the first attempt after a reboot\n\u2022 Fixed haptics being weaker than configured in some apps\n\u2022 Fixed the status bar clock drifting after a timezone change\n\u2022 Fixed auto-rotate ignoring the lock in some apps\n\u2022 Fixed missing album art on the lock screen"
